      <title>一年使用Cursor后62天最长连续 streak 的真实记录</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260902/%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8Cursor%E5%90%8E62%E5%A4%A9%E6%9C%80%E9%95%BF%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD-streak-%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link>
